{"version":1,"content":"<p>韓國人氣女團BLACK PINK成員Jisoo昨晚從韓國出發前往北京，她將以代言人身份出席今晚在北京舉行的奢侈品牌聖誕亮燈活動，她今日凌晨抵達北京，獲大批粉絲接機，她友善地向粉絲揮手，又做出睡覺的手勢，叫大家早點回家休息，非常暖心。</p><p>&lt;</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T06:43:58.053142+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":118,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T06:33:09+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T06:37:14.819592+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T06:37:14.819592+00:00","content_hash":"099fa5b253e6acef30f4c09d3558158c7a80a8464527c122dbd9a6b36dccab85","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}